<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
  <title>Top 5 Caribbean Carnivals — Summer 2026 — countdowns.co</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Vincy Mas, Lucian Carnival, Anguilla Summer Festival, Crop Over and SpiceMas — dates, highlights and tickets for the 5 biggest Caribbean carnivals of summer 2026." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/blog/top-carnivals-2026/" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/blog/top-carnivals-2026/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Top 5 Caribbean Carnivals — Summer 2026" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Vincy Mas, Lucian Carnival, Anguilla Summer Festival, Crop Over and SpiceMas — dates, highlights and tickets, in calendar order." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/images/og-top-carnivals.webp" />
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/images/og-top-carnivals.webp" />
  <style>.t-fr,.t-kr,.t-es{display:none}.lang-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}</style>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #0f0f0f;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }

    .header-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .site-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; color: #fff; }

    .back-link { font-size: 13px; color: #888; }
    .back-link:hover { color: #ccc; }

    .lang-group { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .lang-btn {
      background: transparent; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 3px;
      cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px; padding: 2px 6px; color: #aaa;
      font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.15s; opacity: 0.75;
    }
    .lang-btn:hover { border-color: #888; opacity: 0.8; }
    .lang-btn.active { background: #1a1a1a; border-color: #555; opacity: 1; }

    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a; margin: 24px 0 32px; }

    .post-meta { font-size: 12px; color: #999999; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .post-meta a { color: #0d9488; text-decoration: underline; }

    h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    .intro { font-size: 15px; color: #bbb; margin-bottom: 36px; }

    .carnival { margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .carnival img {
      width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px;
      display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    }
    .carnival h3 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .carnival-rank { color: #0d9488; font-family: monospace; margin-right: 6px; }
    .carnival-when {
      font-size: 12px; color: #5eead4; margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
    }
    .carnival-loc { color: #888; }
    .carnival p { color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .carnival-links { font-size: 13px; display: flex; gap: 16px; }
    .carnival-links a { color: #0d9488; font-weight: 600; }

    .cta {
      background: #101d1a; border: 1px solid #0d9488; border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px 24px; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 14px; color: #bbb;
    }
    .cta a { color: #5eead4; font-weight: 700; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<LiveBanner />
  <main class="page">

    <div class="header-row">
      <h1 class="site-title">
        <a href="/">Countdowns</a>
      </h1>
      <div class="lang-row">
        <a class="back-link" href="/blog/">
          <span class="t-en">← Blog</span>
          <span class="t-fr">← Blog</span>
          <span class="t-kr">← Blog</span>
          <span class="t-es">← Blog</span>
        </a>
        <div class="lang-group">
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="en">EN</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="fr">FR</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="kr">KR</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="es">ES</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <div class="post-meta">
      <span class="t-en">July 2026 · countdowns.co editorial</span>
      <span class="t-fr">Juillet 2026 · éditorial countdowns.co</span>
      <span class="t-kr">Jiyè 2026 · editoryal countdowns.co</span>
      <span class="t-es">Julio de 2026 · editorial countdowns.co</span>
    </div>

    <h2>
      <span class="t-en">The 5 Caribbean carnivals to live this summer 2026</span>
      <span class="t-fr">Les 5 carnavals caribéens à vivre cet été 2026</span>
      <span class="t-kr">5 kanaval karayibeyen pou viv ete 2026 la</span>
      <span class="t-es">Los 5 carnavales caribeños para vivir este verano 2026</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="intro">
      <span class="t-en">From late June to mid-August, the Caribbean turns into one long street party. Five islands, five carnivals, each with its own rhythm — soca, calypso, steelpan, J'ouvert mornings and grand parade finales. Here they are in calendar order, with live countdowns on our home page.</span>
      <span class="t-fr">De fin juin à la mi-août, la Caraïbe se transforme en une immense fête de rue. Cinq îles, cinq carnavals, chacun avec son propre rythme — soca, calypso, steelpan, J'ouvert au petit matin et grandes parades finales. Les voici dans l'ordre du calendrier, avec compte à rebours en direct sur notre page d'accueil.</span>
      <span class="t-kr">Depi fen jen rive mitan out, Karayib la tounen yon gwo fèt lari. Senk zile, senk kanaval, chak ak pwòp ritm li — soca, kalipso, steelpan, J'ouvert bonè bonè epi gran parad final. Men yo nan lòd kalandriye a, ak kontaj annou sou paj akèy la.</span>
      <span class="t-es">De finales de junio a mediados de agosto, el Caribe se convierte en una gran fiesta callejera. Cinco islas, cinco carnavales, cada uno con su propio ritmo — soca, calipso, steelpan, madrugadas de J'ouvert y grandes desfiles finales. Aquí están en orden de calendario, con cuenta regresiva en vivo en nuestra página de inicio.</span>
    </p>

    <!-- 1 · Vincy Mas -->
    <div class="carnival">
      <img src="/images/vincymas.webp" alt="Vincy Mas — Saint Vincent and the Grenadines" width="860" height="400" loading="eager" />
      <h3><span class="carnival-rank">01</span>Vincy Mas</h3>
      <div class="carnival-when">
        <span class="t-en">June 26 – July 7, 2026</span>
        <span class="t-fr">26 juin – 7 juillet 2026</span>
        <span class="t-kr">26 jen – 7 jiyè 2026</span>
        <span class="t-es">26 de junio – 7 de julio de 2026</span>
        <span class="carnival-loc">· Kingstown, Saint Vincent &amp; the Grenadines</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="t-en">The premier carnival of Saint Vincent and the Grenadines opens the season. Calypso and soca monarch competitions build through early July before Mardi Gras closes Kingstown's streets in colour.</span>
        <span class="t-fr">Le carnaval majeur de Saint-Vincent-et-les-Grenadines ouvre la saison. Les concours de calypso et de soca montent en puissance début juillet, avant que le Mardi Gras n'embrase les rues de Kingstown.</span>
        <span class="t-kr">Pi gwo kanaval Sen-Vensan-e-Grenadin yo louvri sezon an. Konkou kalipso ak soca yo monte pandan kòmansman jiyè, anvan Mardi Gras fèmen lari Kingstown yo ak koulè.</span>
        <span class="t-es">El carnaval principal de San Vicente y las Granadinas abre la temporada. Los concursos de calipso y soca crecen a principios de julio antes de que el Mardi Gras llene de color las calles de Kingstown.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="carnival-links">
        <a href="https://vincymas.vc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">vincymas.vc ↗</a>
        <a href="/">
          <span class="t-en">Live countdown →</span>
          <span class="t-fr">Compte à rebours →</span>
          <span class="t-kr">Kontaj an dirèk →</span>
          <span class="t-es">Cuenta regresiva →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2 · Lucian Carnival -->
    <div class="carnival">
      <img src="/images/carnivalsaintlucia.webp" alt="Lucian Carnival — Saint Lucia" width="860" height="400" loading="lazy" />
      <h3><span class="carnival-rank">02</span>Lucian Carnival</h3>
      <div class="carnival-when">
        <span class="t-en">July 1 – 22, 2026</span>
        <span class="t-fr">1 – 22 juillet 2026</span>
        <span class="t-kr">1 – 22 jiyè 2026</span>
        <span class="t-es">1 – 22 de julio de 2026</span>
        <span class="carnival-loc">· Saint Lucia</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="t-en">Three weeks of calypso tents, steelpan and soca across Saint Lucia. The festival spans most of July — the peak travel window is the grand finale parade in the final days.</span>
        <span class="t-fr">Trois semaines de calypso, de steelpan et de soca à travers Sainte-Lucie. Le festival occupe presque tout juillet — le pic à ne pas manquer est la grande parade finale des derniers jours.</span>
        <span class="t-kr">Twa semèn kalipso, steelpan ak soca toupatou nan Sent-Lisi. Festival la pran prèske tout jiyè — pi gwo moman an se gran parad final nan dènye jou yo.</span>
        <span class="t-es">Tres semanas de calipso, steelpan y soca por toda Santa Lucía. El festival ocupa casi todo julio — el momento cumbre es el gran desfile final de los últimos días.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="carnival-links">
        <a href="https://carnivalsaintlucia.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">carnivalsaintlucia.com ↗</a>
        <a href="https://slucarnival.4circlestickets.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="t-en">Tickets ↗</span><span class="t-fr">Billets ↗</span><span class="t-kr">Tikè ↗</span><span class="t-es">Entradas ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/">
          <span class="t-en">Live countdown →</span>
          <span class="t-fr">Compte à rebours →</span>
          <span class="t-kr">Kontaj an dirèk →</span>
          <span class="t-es">Cuenta regresiva →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 · Anguilla Summer Festival -->
    <div class="carnival">
      <img src="/images/anguillasummerfestival.webp" alt="Anguilla Summer Festival" width="860" height="400" loading="lazy" />
      <h3><span class="carnival-rank">03</span>Anguilla Summer Festival</h3>
      <div class="carnival-when">
        <span class="t-en">July 10 – August 9, 2026</span>
        <span class="t-fr">10 juillet – 9 août 2026</span>
        <span class="t-kr">10 jiyè – 9 out 2026</span>
        <span class="t-es">10 de julio – 9 de agosto de 2026</span>
        <span class="carnival-loc">· Anguilla</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="t-en">A month-long celebration unlike any other: carnival energy on land, traditional boat racing at sea. Anguilla's greatest summer cultural experience peaks around August Monday on the beach.</span>
        <span class="t-fr">Une célébration d'un mois unique en son genre : énergie carnaval à terre, courses de bateaux traditionnelles en mer. Le sommet de l'été anguillais culmine autour du August Monday, sur la plage.</span>
        <span class="t-kr">Yon selebrasyon yon mwa ki pa gen parèy : enèji kanaval sou tè, kous kannòt tradisyonèl sou lanmè. Pi gwo eksperyans kiltirèl ete Angwila a rive nan tèt li otou August Monday, sou plaj la.</span>
        <span class="t-es">Una celebración de un mes única: energía de carnaval en tierra, regatas tradicionales en el mar. La gran experiencia cultural del verano de Anguila culmina alrededor del August Monday, en la playa.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="carnival-links">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/axasumfest/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@axasumfest ↗</a>
        <a href="/">
          <span class="t-en">Live countdown →</span>
          <span class="t-fr">Compte à rebours →</span>
          <span class="t-kr">Kontaj an dirèk →</span>
          <span class="t-es">Cuenta regresiva →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 · Crop Over -->
    <div class="carnival">
      <img src="/images/cropoverfestival.webp" alt="Crop Over Festival — Barbados" width="860" height="400" loading="lazy" />
      <h3><span class="carnival-rank">04</span>Crop Over Festival</h3>
      <div class="carnival-when">
        <span class="t-en">July 30 – August 4, 2026</span>
        <span class="t-fr">30 juillet – 4 août 2026</span>
        <span class="t-kr">30 jiyè – 4 out 2026</span>
        <span class="t-es">30 de julio – 4 de agosto de 2026</span>
        <span class="carnival-loc">· Bridgetown, Barbados</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="t-en">Barbados' signature festival, born from the sugar-cane harvest. Soca and calypso take over Bridgetown for the closing week, ending with the Grand Kadooment costumed parade.</span>
        <span class="t-fr">Le festival emblématique de la Barbade, né de la récolte de la canne à sucre. Soca et calypso s'emparent de Bridgetown pour la semaine finale, close par la grande parade costumée du Grand Kadooment.</span>
        <span class="t-kr">Festival senbolik Babad la, ki fèt nan rekòt kann. Soca ak kalipso pran Bridgetown pou dènye semèn nan, ki fini ak gran parad kostime Grand Kadooment lan.</span>
        <span class="t-es">El festival insignia de Barbados, nacido de la cosecha de caña de azúcar. La soca y el calipso toman Bridgetown en la semana final, que cierra con el gran desfile de disfraces Grand Kadooment.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="carnival-links">
        <a href="https://ncf.bb/crop-over/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ncf.bb/crop-over ↗</a>
        <a href="/">
          <span class="t-en">Live countdown →</span>
          <span class="t-fr">Compte à rebours →</span>
          <span class="t-kr">Kontaj an dirèk →</span>
          <span class="t-es">Cuenta regresiva →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 · SpiceMas -->
    <div class="carnival">
      <img src="/images/spicemas.webp" alt="SpiceMas — Grenada Carnival" width="860" height="400" loading="lazy" />
      <h3><span class="carnival-rank">05</span>Grenada Carnival — SpiceMas</h3>
      <div class="carnival-when">
        <span class="t-en">August 5 – 12, 2026</span>
        <span class="t-fr">5 – 12 août 2026</span>
        <span class="t-kr">5 – 12 out 2026</span>
        <span class="t-es">5 – 12 de agosto de 2026</span>
        <span class="carnival-loc">· St. George's, Grenada</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="t-en">The Spice Island's carnival season closes the summer in St. George's. Famous for its J'ouvert — bodies covered in oil and paint at dawn — before soca and calypso carry the final parades.</span>
        <span class="t-fr">La saison carnaval de l'île aux épices clôt l'été à St. George's. Célèbre pour son J'ouvert — corps couverts d'huile et de peinture à l'aube — avant que soca et calypso ne portent les parades finales.</span>
        <span class="t-kr">Sezon kanaval zile epis la fèmen ete a nan St. George's. Li popilè pou J'ouvert li — kò kouvri ak luil ak penti nan douvanjou — anvan soca ak kalipso pote dènye parad yo.</span>
        <span class="t-es">La temporada de carnaval de la isla de las especias cierra el verano en St. George's. Famoso por su J'ouvert — cuerpos cubiertos de aceite y pintura al amanecer — antes de que la soca y el calipso lleven los desfiles finales.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="carnival-links">
        <a href="https://spicemasgrenada.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">spicemasgrenada.com ↗</a>
        <a href="https://spicemasgrenada.com/homepage-7/tickets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="t-en">Tickets ↗</span><span class="t-fr">Billets ↗</span><span class="t-kr">Tikè ↗</span><span class="t-es">Entradas ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/">
          <span class="t-en">Live countdown →</span>
          <span class="t-fr">Compte à rebours →</span>
          <span class="t-kr">Kontaj an dirèk →</span>
          <span class="t-es">Cuenta regresiva →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
      <span class="t-en">70+ Caribbean events with live countdowns, dates and tickets — carnivals, regattas, festivals. <a href="/">See them all →</a></span>
      <span class="t-fr">70+ événements caribéens avec compte à rebours en direct, dates et billets — carnavals, régates, festivals. <a href="/">Les voir tous →</a></span>
      <span class="t-kr">70+ evenman karayibeyen ak kontaj an dirèk, dat epi tikè — kanaval, regat, festival. <a href="/">Gade yo tout →</a></span>
      <span class="t-es">70+ eventos caribeños con cuenta regresiva en vivo, fechas y entradas — carnavales, regatas, festivales. <a href="/">Verlos todos →</a></span>
    </div>

  </main>

  <script is:inline src="/scripts/lang.js" defer></script>
<PageFooter />
</body>
</html>
